      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i got this red patch on my calf that looks like ringworm or something. it’s pretty itchy but it's also feeling kinda warm to the touch and the redness seems to be spreading up towards my knee a little bit. i dont really want to go to the er if i dont have to, can i just use some antifungal cream or maybe some hydrocortisone to get it to go away?",
