      "role": "user",
      "content": "dermatitis? i thought that was just an allergy. it doesn't really hurt, just feels a bit tight and warm. im just really busy with work right now and waiting for an appointment takes forever. is there any way i can tell if it's getting better or worse on my own? like, if i just put some neosporin on it and wait a few days, what should i look out for?",
